  "next_action": "Construct or refute one factored arbitrary-squarefree dynamic-evaluation operator for the unified signed elliptic translate product. Keep U,V and all N target factors factored, split U only by charged gcds at actual nonunits, share the elimination work across every CRT component, and emit C_h mod U or G_1 in softly O(n+N) total work. Reject one order-n x-adic surrogate, n independent local resultants, N quotient-ring elements, Theta(N^2) coefficient expansion, nN or n^2 grids, candidate inversions, and unit-cost resultant, norm, multipoint, root, count, marginal, rank, or source oracles.",
